# Block model exports.
# Real models run to hundreds of MB — the 2M-block test file was 121 MB and the
# 5M-block one was 303 MB. GitHub warns above 50 MB and REJECTS any single file
# over 100 MB, so these must never be committed. The small generated fixture
# referenced by CLAUDE.md is the one deliberate exception.
*.csv
!example_block_model.csv

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Claude Code machine-specific settings (permissions granted on this laptop only)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Scratch
*.tmp
*.log
serve/
